  "description": "Spreadsheet IDataSource companion for ToolUp.Platform. Reads .xlsx / .xlsm workbooks through IBlobStorage (any provider, including LocalFileStorage for files on disk). Sheets, Excel Tables (ListObjects) and workbook-scoped named ranges are all addressable as first-class table names; schema is inferred by type-probing a configurable row sample and Query emits RFC 4180 CSV. Cached values only — no formula evaluation and no Power Query refresh.",
